# TROJAN Account Management Tests

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@apiKey = your_api_key_here

### Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Create TROJAN Account
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/trojan/
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

{
  "username": "testtrojan",
  "password": "testpassword",
  "exp": "30",
  "ip_quota": "5",
  "server_id": 1
}

### Check TROJAN Account
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/trojan/check
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

{
  "username": "testtrojan"
}

### Renew TROJAN Account
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/trojan/renew
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

{
  "username": "testtrojan",
  "exp": "15",
  "server_id": 1
}

### Delete TROJAN Account
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/trojan/delete
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

{
  "username": "testtrojan",
  "server_id": 1
}

### Create TROJAN Account (General Endpoint)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/accounts
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

{
  "username": "testtrojan2",
  "password": "testpassword",
  "exp": "30",
  "ip_quota": "5",
  "server_id": 1,
  "account_type": "trojan"
}

### Check TROJAN Account (General Endpoint)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/accounts/check
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

{
  "username": "testtrojan2",
  "account_type": "trojan"
}

### Renew TROJAN Account (General Endpoint)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/accounts/renew
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

{
  "username": "testtrojan2",
  "exp": "15",
  "server_id": 1,
  "account_type": "trojan"
}

### Delete TROJAN Account (General Endpoint)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/accounts/delete
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

{
  "username": "testtrojan2",
  "server_id": 1,
  "account_type": "trojan"
}